Hello everyone!
I've made a small decision to remove the demo from now from Steam, due it's not representing the current state of the game.

In the following month, my goal is to produce a new demo which would be the "almost" definite one. 

[b]My goal in the demo is to include:[/b]
[list]
[*] The new Board Style/combat that I've been working on and showing on the discord;
[*] Maps for the 3 Biomes (Plains, Desert, Snow) (Up to 10 maps), Using it's basic system (Terrain will just give you def and movement restrictions, In the future I plan to have some extra terrains that will do different stuff, like healing, trapping for 1 turn, give damage, etc..);
[*] Single Player (vs AI) and PvP (basically the current state, due Local or Steam Remote Play);
[*] Maps with pre-deployed units;
[*] Not all units available: Still couple of them I need to work on:
[*] Expect 100% this units: Infantry, Flamethrower, Bazooka, Sniper, ARV, Hover, Spider, Missiles, IFV, Tank, Artillery, Defender, Inferno
[*] Don't expect at all this units: Transport, Ram, Ballistic, Magnet, Drill, Mega;
[*] 50%/50% Expect: Scout
[*] Select your Team Color/Nation;
[/list]

[b]Things I may or may not be able to include:[/b]
[list]
[*] 1 Procedural Random Map (to see if people like it the randomness);
[*] Some Updated SFX for units;
[*] Maps with Build your Units System (and including the below)
[*] Basic Conquering Buildings Functionality;
[*] Basic Income Functionality (Get $ each turn by the amount of buildings you have, so you can buy new units);
[*] Basic Victory conditions- Conquer HQ , Destroying all enemy units and Surrender;
[/list]

[b]Things I will not include:[/b]
[list]
[*] Story mode;
[*] Commanders (we are still finishing commander 2 (out of 8) so they will take a bit while);
[*] Nation/Commander Powers;
[*] More work on the Main Menus (just basic adjustments);
[*] New Music
[*] Map Creator;
[/list]

That's it! Expect a new demo soon!

Thanks! and [b]Avante![/b]

